	seconds - how long each event phase lasts.

### Raklion::BossEgg ###
	Half/Max - Boss Egg spawn thresholds (Half notifies when
	half the eggs remain, Max is the total count).

### Raklion::SelupanSkill ###
	Delay in ms between Selupan's skill casts.

### Raklion::SelupanPattern ###
	Pattern1-6 - HP% thresholds (descending) at which Selupan
	changes attack pattern.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

